	(title_block
		(title "CEC ENT KVM carrier -- Path C (M3C on CEC carrier, P4-fronted)")
		(date "2026-07-02")
		(rev "DRAFT")
		(company "CEC")
		(comment 1 "DRAFT / ENT lane. Owner ruling 2026-07-06: Path C -- Sipeed M3C compute module on a CEC carrier behind the uniform P4 trust endpoint")
		(comment 2 "Sheets 01-05 = the ent-common P4+T1 block (reused wholesale; 04 gains supervisor GPIOs); 06-10 = carrier: USB gate, compute power, sockets, HDMI")
		(comment 3 "Inherited nets cross as drawn sheet-pin wires; ALL new carrier nets are GLOBAL LABELS (flag F10 -- the 1:1 lane router cannot express the buses)")
		(comment 4 "Zero-egress: T1 is the ONLY network silicon; module EPHY unmagnetized, SDIO/RGMII dark (verifiable absence, spec 13.6)")
	)
